---------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE OF THE ABOVE

The MIT licence above covers only what this 1.6 version added:

  - the rewritten patch layer and loadFolders.xml
  - the three uncooked bean stew defs
  - the packaging and the documentation

IT DOES NOT COVER THE ORIGINAL MOD. The idea of running Vanilla Cooking
Expanded's processors on [SYR] Processor Framework, every ProcessDef and every
one of its values - capacityFactor, efficiency, processDays, usesQuality,
qualityDays - and every defName are Daemon976's work, reused here:

  https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2887181698

No licence was declared for them, so none is granted here and none can be.
They are redistributed under the usual practice for abandoned mods - explicit
credit, a link to the original, and removal on request.

If Daemon976 asks for this to be taken down, it comes down. Immediately, and
without discussion.

This mod redistributes no artwork: it ships no textures of its own, and the
uncooked bean stews point at texture paths resolved at runtime from the VCE -
Stews add-on's folder.

ATTRIBUTION.md records what was taken and what was changed.
